  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 79a9b0d3c10b22a4a84c5418b36511d6, type: 3}
  m_Name: ParkEntrence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogues:
  - name: Knut
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - What is this place?
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - My grandmother says that this used to be something called a park, full of greenery
      and flowers.
  - name: Knut
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "I didn\u2019t realise there were places like this in Neokalmar."
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Wait... What are all these drones doing here?
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Dunno. They weren\u2019t here earlier."
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - I wonder what might have caused them to flock like this.
    - Wait... Is that a turret?
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "We can\u2019t risk them following us back to Sk\xE4rstad. Let\u2019s do this
      carefully."
